[h2]Build 0.9.25[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Ancient Mining Industry:[/b] the ore dresser (and any other machine of that mod that takes stone chunks from around it) can now be fed by this mod. When it is empty, switched on and has no chunk lying on the ground around it, it takes one straight out of a VFE belt running through the ring of cells around it, or out of a delivered capsule in a tube receiver built in that ring. An emptied capsule is left as a shell for haulers. Chunks on the ground still work as before.
[/list]
